  "remarks": "Former member of the so-called “People’s Council” of the so-called “Donetsk People’s Republic”, and former head of the so-called “Young Republic” organisation. Former so-called “Acting Minister of Youth Policy” of the so-called “Donetsk People’s Republic”. Currently serving as so-called “Deputy Chairman” of the Government of the so-called “Donetsk People’s Republic”. Kirill Makarov has therefore supported and implemented actions and policies which undermine the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine, and further destabilise Ukraine.",
